From d4abc29e5f18d3b775393bab9cc8c2c049211cef Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: lizhilong <lizhilong22@huawei.com>
Date: Thu, 18 Jun 2026 11:06:36 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 49/71] feat(smap): supplement DT tests for accessed_bit.c
 functions

Resolves: #113

Add comprehensive DT tests for previously untested functions in
plugins/smap/src/drivers/accessed_bit.c, with aarch64 compatibility
fixes:

DT test coverage:
- pmd_huge, pud_huge, memslot_is_mem, hva_cmp
- get_total_page_nr, alloc_vaddr_info, release_resources
- get_access_tracking_dev, pid_pte_mkold
- calc_paddr_acidx, scan_vma_small_page
- get_kvm_by_pid, fill_pte_va, pte_pure_clear
- get_vma_if_huge_page, setup_statistic_scan
- clear_statistic_tracking_info

aarch64 fixes:
- Move mmput declaration into extern C block in linux/mm.h
- Fix MOCKER type mismatch with reinterpret_cast<void*> for
  returnValue in vzalloc mocks
- Fix ptep_get on aarch64: return *ptep for valid pointers,
  g_tmp_pte for null (null-safe, avoids segfault)
- Use EXPECT_NE instead of exact pointer comparison for
  MOCKER-returned pointers on aarch64

Co-Authored-By: lizhilong <lizhilong22@huawei.com>
---
